{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a reporter, you were following up on a lead that some paranormal activity was going on deep in the woods. You were sneaking around an area you should not have.\u00a0 Men working for a shadowy group captured you and locked you in a makeshift cell in the basement of an old farm house.\u00a0 During one of your scheduled feeding time from the guards, you managed to carefully grab a key from his belt.\u00a0 The time to escape is now.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an Unreal Engine 5 game where the player must find keys to unlock the next area.\u00a0 The game is a short 5 minute horror experience with jump-scares.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049140?t=1762276371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049140/bc23e6c0f3aa206c64191257eb42e0bcc54b792c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762276371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049140/bbe18ea58156154ee49cf48a94d3403ce2d249fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762276371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049140/bbe18ea58156154ee49cf48a94d3403ce2d249fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762276371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This is a horror game with a demon doll.  The doll performs jump scares."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a reporter, you were following up on a lead that some paranormal activity was going on deep in the woods. You were sneaking around an area you should not have.\u00a0 Men working for a shadowy group captured you and locked you in a makeshift cell in the basement of an old farm house.\u00a0 During one of your